{
  "name": "WatermarkKit",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "summary": "图片与视频水印工具库，支持文字/图片水印、九宫格布局、平铺与批量处理。",
  "description": "WatermarkKit 是一个同时覆盖「相册图片/视频加水印」与「AI 生成内容自动加水印」两类场景的\nSwift 工具库。\n\n- 文字与图片水印，支持描边、阴影、旋转、平铺与多水印叠加\n- 几何量全部归一化，同一份配置在任意分辨率下视觉一致\n- 视频走 AVMutableVideoComposition + CALayer 系统级合成，长视频无内存爆炸风险\n- 正确处理 preferredTransform，横竖屏与前置摄像头镜像素材方位无误\n- 图片输出经 CGImageDestination 保留 EXIF 元数据，GPS 单独开关\n- 核心 async/await，附带 Combine 与 completion handler 便利层",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/artspace-io/WatermarkKit",
  "license": {
    "type": "MIT",
    "file": "LICENSE"
  },
  "authors": {
    "Robin": "enamourchen@outlook.com"
  },
  "source": {
    "git": "https://github.com/artspace-io/WatermarkKit.git",
    "tag": "0.1.0"
  },
  "platforms": {
    "ios": "16.0"
  },
  "swift_versions": [
    "5.9"
  ],
  "default_subspecs": "Core",
  "subspecs": [
    {
      "name": "Core",
      "source_files": "WatermarkKit/Classes/Core/**/*.swift",
      "frameworks": [
        "UIKit",
        "AVFoundation",
        "CoreMedia",
        "CoreImage",
        "CoreGraphics",
        "ImageIO",
        "UniformTypeIdentifiers",
        "Combine"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Photos",
      "source_files": "WatermarkKit/Classes/Photos/**/*.swift",
      "dependencies": {
        "WatermarkKit/Core": []
      },
      "frameworks": "Photos"
    }
  ],
  "swift_version": "5.9"
}
